.TH "INSPEKT\-DOWNLOAD" "1" "2026\-04\-16" "Inspekt 1.0.0" "User Commands"
.SH NAME
inspekt\-download \- Find and download files from the current page.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\f[B]inspekt\f[R] \f[B]download\f[R] [\f[I]OPTIONS\f[R]]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Find and download files from the current page.
.PP
Discovers images, PDFs, videos, audio files, documents and archives.
Uses interactive selection with gum choose if available.
.PP
\f[B]Options:\f[R]
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-o, \-\-output\f[R]: Output directory (default: \(ti/Downloads/)
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-list\f[R]: Only list files without downloading
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-json\f[R]: Output as JSON (requires \(enlist)
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-open\f[R]: Open downloaded file in default application
.IP \(bu 2
\f[CR]\-\-reveal\f[R]: Reveal downloaded file in file explorer
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\f[B]\-o\f[R], \f[B]\(enoutput\f[R], \f[I]PATH\f[R]
Output directory (default: \(ti/Downloads/)
.TP
\f[B]\(enlist\f[R]
Only list files without downloading
.TP
\f[B]\(enjson\f[R]
Output as JSON (requires \(enlist)
.TP
\f[B]\-t\f[R], \f[B]\(entimeout\f[R], \f[I]FLOAT\f[R]
Timeout in seconds (default: 30)
.TP
\f[B]\(enopen\f[R]
